    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kir'ekyo halitabuka enchuro aha rw'oruganda rwa Daudi n'abanyansi ba Yerusalemu ey'okubogya amafu n'obuhagare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kyonene ekyo, inye, Omukama w'amahe, omu nsi egi ndichwamu ebihuuku n'amabara gabyo, biliba bitakijukwa. Kwakwo ndichwamu abarangi n'okuronkwa kufukamira ebihuuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahalizoka omurangi ondijo, ishe na nyina balimugira bati, ‘Noija kufa iwe, kuba nogamba ebishuba nojuliza Omukama.’ Kandi k'aliranga, ishe na nyina abamuzaire balimutera eichumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kyonene ekyo buli murangi k'aliranga eby'aliba abonekeirwe alikwatwa enshoni. Kandi talijwara bebo elikubaba kubeiya bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shana aligira ati, ‘Inye timba murangi, mba mulimi; kwema obusigazi eitaka nilyo liba itunga lyange.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi k'omuntu alimubaza ati, ‘Ezo enkoju ezikuli aha mugongo okazihyahai?’ Alihorora ati, ‘Nkahutalira omwa batahi bange.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
